><body><p><related-article related-article-type="corrected-article" vol="168" page="643" id="N0x1c20cb0N0x3b9c9c0" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="15716381" ext-link-type="pubmed">Vol. 168, No. 4, February, 2005. Pages 643&#x02013;653.</related-article></p><p>Information from a band in Figure 3 B was inadvertently incorporated by the authors into Figure 2 F, so that portions of the two figures appeared identical. Figure 2 is shown below with the correct original data, as submitted to reviewers.</p><p><fig position="float" id="uro1"><label>Figure </label><graphic xlink:href="1693cor2f2"></graphic></fig></p></body></article>